      "text": "model.default: openrouter/free   (OpenRouter \u2014 auto-routed :free SKU)\nfallback_providers: [{provider: custom:hetzner, model: Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8}]\nproviders.hetzner.api: https://inference.hetzner.com/api/v1\nkeys set per-profile in profiles/<name>/.env (not interactive `hermes model`)\nVerified: hermes -p odoo19-dev -z \"pong\" --cli -> real completion",
