    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "phase8_evidence_text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 2890,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "pilot: edit_remove_pricelist_rule (18.0), sandbox session phase8-pricelist-18\nstep 7 (live UI): real KeyError<NewId> bug fixed in _compute_pricelist_rule_count\n  -> counts.get(pricelist.id, 0); verified via live sandboxed browser session\nstep 9 (docs): /testing regenerated coverage_summary.md, index.html,\n  CLAUDE.md/GEMINI.md/AGENTS.md context-handoff files inside the sandbox\nstep 10 (resume): fresh Codex session resumed correctly from only\n  CLAUDE.md + docs/tasks.md \u2014 no continuation from the writing session\ntests: sandboxctl module ... test -> succeeded, exit 0, 0 failed/0 error of 8",
      "originalText": "pilot: edit_remove_pricelist_rule (18.0), sandbox session phase8-pricelist-18\nstep 7 (live UI): real KeyError<NewId> bug fixed in _compute_pricelist_rule_count\n  -> counts.get(pricelist.id, 0); verified via live sandboxed browser session\nstep 9 (docs): /testing regenerated coverage_summary.md, index.html,\n  CLAUDE.md/GEMINI.md/AGENTS.md context-handoff files inside the sandbox\nstep 10 (resume): fresh Codex session resumed correctly from only\n  CLAUDE.md + docs/tasks.md \u2014 no continuation from the writing session\ntests: sandboxctl module ... test -> succeeded, exit 0, 0 failed/0 error of 8",
