    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "phase8_gate_text",
      "x": 925,
      "y": 2890,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Phase 8 exit gate \u2014 still OPEN (broader batch-readiness, beyond the pilot):\n- A second Tier-1 (17.0-only) module migrated inside a sandbox session\n- A module with a real Odoo Enterprise dependency (detection only, no\n  fetching/bundling/committing licensed source)\n- Wall-clock time + Sandbox resource usage measured for one full run\n- Standalone Phase 8 design note (docs/docker-sandbox/phase-8/design.md)\n- Go/no-go decision on batching the remaining ~45 backlog modules",
      "originalText": "Phase 8 exit gate \u2014 still OPEN (broader batch-readiness, beyond the pilot):\n- A second Tier-1 (17.0-only) module migrated inside a sandbox session\n- A module with a real Odoo Enterprise dependency (detection only, no\n  fetching/bundling/committing licensed source)\n- Wall-clock time + Sandbox resource usage measured for one full run\n- Standalone Phase 8 design note (docs/docker-sandbox/phase-8/design.md)\n- Go/no-go decision on batching the remaining ~45 backlog modules",
      "fontSize": 13,
